<view class="container">
  <view class="profile-section" bindtap="onTapAvatar">
    <view class="avatar-wrap">
      <image
        wx:if="{{user.avatar}}"
        src="{{user.avatar}}"
        class="avatar-big"
        mode="aspectFill"
      ></image>
      <view wx:else class="avatar-big avatar-default">{{user.nickname[0] || '我'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="avatar-hint">{{uploading ? '上传中...' : '点击更换头像'}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="onTapNickname">
      <text class="label">昵称</text>
      <view class="value-wrap">
        <text class="value">{{user.nickname || '我'}}</text>
        <text class="chevron">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="onTapProfile">
      <text class="label">我的恋爱档案</text>
      <view class="value-wrap">
        <text class="value">让 AI 更像你</text>
        <text class="chevron">›</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="row" bindtap="onTapTerms">
      <text class="label">用户协议</text>
      <view class="value-wrap"><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="row" bindtap="onTapPrivacy">
      <text class="label">隐私政策</text>
      <view class="value-wrap"><text class="chevron">›</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tip">
    昵称和头像只在聊天页「我」这一边展示，AI 不会知道。{'\n'}「我的恋爱档案」里的资料才会用来让 AI 模仿你的口吻、找共同点。
  </view>
</view>
